WEBVTT

00:00:29.289 --> 00:00:33.595
When you decode the world
with design intent in mind,

00:00:33.619 --> 00:00:36.020
the world becomes kind of magical.

00:00:36.044 --> 00:00:38.341
Instead of seeing the broken things,

00:00:38.365 --> 00:00:40.642
you see all the little bits of genius

00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:45.146
that anonymous designers have sweated over
to make our lives better.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.481
And that's essentially
the definition of design:

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:50.615
making life better and providing joy.

00:00:51.245 --> 00:00:53.516
And few things give me greater joy

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.700
than a well-designed flag.

00:00:56.596 --> 00:00:57.746
(Laughter)

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.033
Yeah!

00:00:59.057 --> 00:01:01.255
(Applause)